        {
          "id": "69086d3a45bf84d4748b0cc5",
          "questionNumber": 1,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>Find the sum of digit of missing number of series?</p>\n\n<p>119, 133,161, 203, ?</p>",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "10",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "12",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "14",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "11",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "18",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "1",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p><strong>Given Series:&nbsp;</strong>119, 133,161, 203, ?</p>\n\n<p><strong>Logic</strong>: Each term = 7 &times; Consecutive Prime number.</p>\n\n<p>Prime numbers: 17, 19, 23, 29, 31</p>\n\n<p>7 &times; 17 = 119</p>\n\n<p>7 &times; 19 = 133</p>\n\n<p>7 &times; 23 = 161</p>\n\n<p>7 &times; 29 = 203</p>\n\n<p>Next = 7 &times; 31 = 217</p>\n\n<p>Missing number = 217</p>\n\n<p>Sum of digits = 2 + 1 + 7 = 10</p>\n\n<p>Answer: 10</p>",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
        {
          "id": "6620f479e89e5642c8d2f471",
          "questionNumber": 2,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>Find the missing number in the series</p>\n\n<p>25, 54, ?, 122, 163, 206</p>",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "118",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "119",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "85&nbsp;",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "120",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "121",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "3",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The series follows the following pattern (consecutive prime numbers)</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 25 + 29 = 54</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 54 + 31 = <strong>85</strong></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 85 + 37 = 122</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 122 + 41 = 163</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 163 + 43 = 206</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&there4; The missing number is 85</span></p>",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
        {
