          "questionNumber": 3,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>Find the missing number in the series</p>\n\n<p>1, 7, -5, 13, ?, 19</p>",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "37",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "35",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "- 37",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "11",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "- 11",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "5",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The series follows the following pattern</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 1 + 6 = 7</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 7 - 12 = - 5</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; - 5 + 18 = 13</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 13 - 24 =<strong> -11</strong></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; - 11 + 30 = 19</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&there4; The missing number is -11</span></p>",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
        {
          "id": "6620ed41df20487a5d0ca8e1",
          "questionNumber": 4,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>Find the missing number in the series</p>\n\n<p>12, 26, 50, 102, ?, 406</p>",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "204",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "206",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "202",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "200",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "208",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "3",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The series follows the following pattern</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 12&nbsp;&times; 2 + 2 =26</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 26&nbsp;&times; 2 - 2 = 50</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 50&nbsp;&times; 2 + 2 = 102</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 102&nbsp;&times; 2 - 2 = <strong>202</strong></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 202&nbsp;&times; 2 + 2 = 406</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&there4; The missing number is 202</span></p>",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
        {
