          ],
          "correctOptionId": "3",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The series follows the following pattern</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 6 +&nbsp;2<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 10</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 10 + 3<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 19</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 19 + 4<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 35</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 35 + 5<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 60</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 60 + 6<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= <strong>96</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&there4; The missing number is 96</span></p>",
          "topic": "Test"
