          ],
          "correctOptionId": "3",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The series follows the following pattern</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 8&nbsp;&times; 0.5 + 1 = 5</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 5&nbsp;&times; 1 + 2 = 7</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 7&nbsp;&times; 2 + 3 = 17</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 17&nbsp;&times; 4 + 4 = 72</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 72&nbsp;&times; 8 + 5 = <strong>581</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&there4; The missing number is 581</span></p>",
          "topic": "Test"
