          "explanation": "<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The series follows the following pattern</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 7&nbsp;&times; 1 - 1 = 6</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 6&nbsp;&times; 2 - 2 = 10</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 10&nbsp;&times; 3 - 3 = 27</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 27&nbsp;&times; 4 - 4 = <strong>104</strong></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 104&nbsp;&times; 5 - 5 = 515</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&there4; The missing number is 104</span></p>",
