          "explanation": "<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The series follows the following pattern</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 8&nbsp;&times; 2 = 16</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 16&nbsp;&times; 3 = 48</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 48&nbsp;&times; 4 = 192</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 192&nbsp;&times; 5 = 960</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; 960&nbsp;&times; 6 = <strong>5760</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&there4; The missing number is 5760</span></p>",
