          ],
          "correctOptionId": "1",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p>The correct answer is:&nbsp;<strong>1</strong></p>\n\n<p><b>Given:</b></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">5, ?, 104, 655, 4314</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><strong>Calculation:</strong></span></p>\n\n<p>The series follows the following pattern:</p>\n\n<p>(5 + 1<sup>3</sup>) x 3 = 18</p>\n\n<p>(18 + 2<sup>3</sup>) x 4 = 104</p>\n\n<p>(104 + 3<sup>3</sup>) x 5 = 655</p>\n\n<p>(655 + 4<sup>3</sup>) x 6 = 4314</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 36);   \">&there4;<strong>&nbsp;18 will come in place of ?</strong></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "topic": "Test"
